We need to estimate buyer range. He wants cash before rent. Likely buyers want cheap laptops, maybe below $500. So setting 500 might be too high. Maybe set 460? That would still match if buyer >=460. But many may pay 460. We can't be sure. Setting 400 is safe. But price might be ~395. Setting 420 gives higher price if match. I think 420 is a good compromise: hopefully there are buyers with 420+. The market may have many? Hard to know. So I'll set 420.

